// Local.xcconfig -- The template for Local.xcconfig. Copy it, do not edit it, and nothing else.
//
// This is the migration's version of the username class: a committed
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM builds on one Mac and fails everywhere else with a
// provisioning error that does not explain itself. It is the only loud failure
// in the whole definition-of-done table, which is the argument for keeping it
// out of the project rather than in it.
//
// A second developer copies Local.xcconfig.example and puts their own team here.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
